{"id": "69266", "title": "锦城四少", "author": "彼岸锦色", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 19, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69266.htm", "intro": "顾云清、尹潇、陆子言、苏景默，这四人，打小便是锦城里有名的顽主儿，好容易一个个风姿俊逸了， \r\n便有人送诨名“锦城四少”， \r\n且不说这里头有多少调侃的成分， \r\n在锦城里，这锦城四少的名头还是响当当的。 \r\n先说尹潇，丫就是一大尾巴狼，见天地招摇过市； \r\n再说顾云清，小时候见我，回回吹胡子瞪眼，现如今，却时不时占我点儿小便宜，小名儿起的倒是挺正义的； \r\n苏景默嘛，那是我亲哥； \r\n至于陆子言，丫就一王八羔子，不说也罢，只是几年前，在他还不是王八羔子时，我曾今很喜欢很喜欢这小子……", "base": "files/article/html/69/69266", "chapters": [{"title": "1-7", "file": "10594871.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8-15", "file": "10594872.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-22", "file": "10594873.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23-27", "file": "10594874.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28-33", "file": "10594875.html", "available": false}, {"title": "34-39", "file": "10594876.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40-45", "file": "10594877.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-52", "file": "10594878.html", "available": false}, {"title": "53-59", "file": "10594879.html", "available": false}, {"title": "60-66", "file": "10594880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "67-73", "file": "10594881.html", "available": false}, {"title": "74-81", "file": "10594882.html", "available": false}, {"title": "82-87", "file": "10594883.html", "available": false}, {"title": "88-93", "file": "10594884.html", "available": false}, {"title": "94-98", "file": "10594885.html", "available": false}, {"title": "99-103", "file": "10594886.html", "available": false}, {"title": "104-109", "file": "10594887.html", "available": false}, {"title": "110-115", "file": "10594888.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10594889.html", "available": false}]}